do MusicPlayer.pause_music()
audio "res://Audio/Music/TutorialCutscene.wav" [bus="Music"]
CropDuster: Crop Duster here. \
\
I do everything related to Weapon Tech for the Starspire Hunters Guild. \
Thanks for fixing up the old Smelting Furnace, you did us a big favor. Let me know if you need any assistance with anything crafting related.
CropDuster: Just like the Cooking Range, the Smelting Furnace works the same way. Bring your ingredients to the station, any related recipes will pop up - select one and the quanttiy, and off you go.
CropDuster: Oh I almost forgot. Remember those big rocks in the tower? You can now mine those with a pick axe.
CropDuster: *Hands you a stone pick axe* (SFX should play here in the future)
CropDuster: It's not much, but it should be a start with excavating resources so you can actually use this damn thing here. Check out the upgrades in the tech tree - things can actually get pretty crazy there in terms of mining upgrades - eventually you'll be able to improve your pickaxe. If efficiency is your name, then them upgrades will be your game.
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.set_camera_to_player()
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do MusicPlayer.unpause_music()